  "body": "In the [filter API](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.0#post-matrix-client-r0-user-userid-filter), the `StateFilter` and `RoomEventFilter` types seem to have an exactly identical definition.\r\n\r\nIs this intentional (eg. to denote a future semantic difference) or a bug? And if it is intentional, shouldn't it include a note that the two are currently the same, so that an implementer doesn't need to read both and (expect to) spot the differences?",
